,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2660"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Start of each entry in seconds. Same length as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"texts"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"texts","children":[{"type":"text","value":"texts"}]},{"type":"code","value":"texts: string[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2658","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2658"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Entry text, in audio order."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"unit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"unit"}]},{"type":"code","value":"unit: \"character\" | \"word\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2656","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2656"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Granularity of each entry."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"endseconds","text":"endSeconds","level":3},{"id":"startseconds","text":"startSeconds","level":3},{"id":"texts","text":"texts","level":3},{"id":"unit","text":"unit","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2654](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2654)\n\nTimings for the generated audio, returned when `timestamps: true` was\nrequested and the adapter declares `capabilities.timestamps`.\n\nGranularity differs per provider — ElevenLabs reports characters, BytePlus\nreports words — so `unit` says which, and the three arrays are parallel.\nAll times are **seconds**; adapters convert.\n\n## Properties\n\n### endSeconds\n\n```ts\nendSeconds: number[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2662](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2662)\n\nEnd of each entry in seconds. Same length as `texts`.\n\n***\n\n### startSeconds\n\n```ts\nstartSeconds: number[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2660](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2660)\n\nStart of each entry in seconds. Same length as `texts`.\n\n***\n\n### texts\n\n```ts\ntexts: string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2658](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2658)\n\nEntry text, in audio order.\n\n***\n\n### unit\n\n```ts\nunit: \"character\" | \"word\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2656](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2656)\n\nGranularity of each entry.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TTSAlignment\ntitle: TTSAlignment\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2654](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2654)\n\nTimings for the generated audio, returned when `timestamps: true` was\nrequested and the adapter declares `capabilities.timestamps`.\n\nGranularity differs per provider — ElevenLabs reports characters, BytePlus\nreports words — so `unit` says which, and the three arrays are parallel.\nAll times are **seconds**; adapters convert.\n\n## Properties\n\n### endSeconds\n\n```ts\nendSeconds: number[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2662](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2662)\n\nEnd of each entry in seconds. Same length as `texts`.\n\n***\n\n### startSeconds\n\n```ts\nstartSeconds: number[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2660](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2660)\n\nStart of each entry in seconds. Same length as `texts`.\n\n***\n\n### texts\n\n```ts\ntexts: string[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2658](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2658)\n\nEntry text, in audio order.\n\n***\n\n### unit\n\n```ts\nunit: \"character\" | \"word\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2656](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2656)\n\nGranularity of each entry.\n"}
